{"unit_id":"Z-6354__dsh-mobile-hanui#card-zh","repo":"Z-6354/dsh-mobile-hanui","commit":"27f11e7b7925fafcd63926dfefde11cfc1197cf3","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-mobile-hanui 是面向 DeepSeek Harness Web 客户端的手机界面适配插件，在视口不超过 1023px 时启用移动样式与交互。它通过 shell.overlay 注入 React 组件，把侧栏和详情面板作为抽屉呈现，并提供可拖动的菜单浮钮与遮罩关闭操作；同时调整弹窗、会话标题、输入区和统计信息布局，抑制切换会话时自动弹出的软键盘，并在滚到聊天顶部时自动加载更早历史。适合在手机浏览器或窄窗口中使用 DSH Web 的用户；需要已有 DSH Web 客户端运行，无需额外 API 密钥或插件配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client.js:29-40","src/client.js:933-940","src/client.js:1525-1551"]}
{"unit_id":"Z-6354__dsh-mobile-hanui#card-en","repo":"Z-6354/dsh-mobile-hanui","commit":"27f11e7b7925fafcd63926dfefde11cfc1197cf3","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-mobile-hanui adapts DSH Web for phone sized screens. It injects mobile drawers, a draggable menu button and responsive panel styles, suppresses automatic keyboard popups after session changes, and loads earlier chat history at the top. For DSH Web users; no API key is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client.js:29-40","src/client.js:933-940","src/client.js:1525-1551"]}
