{"unit_id":"Z-6354__dsh-mobile-hanui#readme-1","repo":"Z-6354/dsh-mobile-hanui","commit":"27f11e7b7925fafcd63926dfefde11cfc1197cf3","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-mobile-hanui README · dsh-mobile-hanui：让 DeepSeek Harness 的 Web 界面在手机上正常使用。\n\n[](https://www.npmjs.com/package/dsh-mobile-hanui)\n[](./LICENSE)","source":"extracted","section":"dsh-mobile-hanui"}
{"unit_id":"Z-6354__dsh-mobile-hanui#readme-2","repo":"Z-6354/dsh-mobile-hanui","commit":"27f11e7b7925fafcd63926dfefde11cfc1197cf3","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-mobile-hanui README · 它解决什么问题：DSH 的网页界面是按桌面端设计的，在手机浏览器上会出现侧边栏撑满屏幕、弹窗错位、输入框被裁剪等问题。这个插件会在窄屏（手机 / 窄窗口，视口宽度 ≤ 1023px）下自动把界面调整成适合触屏的布局。\n\n它只影响手机端显示，桌面端没有任何变化。","source":"extracted","section":"它解决什么问题"}
{"unit_id":"Z-6354__dsh-mobile-hanui#readme-3","repo":"Z-6354/dsh-mobile-hanui","commit":"27f11e7b7925fafcd63926dfefde11cfc1197cf3","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-mobile-hanui README · 做了什么：- 侧边栏、详情面板变成左右抽屉，点一下滑出，不再挤压聊天区\n- 提问、权限确认、设置等弹窗在手机上全屏居中显示，不再被裁掉\n- 悬浮菜单按钮（可拖动），点击/下拉打开侧边栏\n- 上滑到顶部自动加载更早的对话历史\n- 切换会话不再自动弹出软键盘\n- 子代理目录、模型选择、推理等级、模式选择在小屏正常显示","source":"extracted","section":"做了什么"}
{"unit_id":"Z-6354__dsh-mobile-hanui#readme-4","repo":"Z-6354/dsh-mobile-hanui","commit":"27f11e7b7925fafcd63926dfefde11cfc1197cf3","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-mobile-hanui README · 安装：```bash\ncd ~/.dsh/profiles/web\npnpm add dsh-mobile-hanui\n```\n\n然后在 `~/.dsh/profiles/web/package.json` 的 `dsh.profile.bundles` 数组里加入 `\"dsh-mobile-hanui\"`，重启 `dsh web` 服务。\n\n安装并重启后，在手机打开 DSH 网页即可，无需其它配置。","source":"extracted","section":"安装"}
{"unit_id":"Z-6354__dsh-mobile-hanui#readme-5","repo":"Z-6354/dsh-mobile-hanui","commit":"27f11e7b7925fafcd63926dfefde11cfc1197cf3","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-mobile-hanui README · 临时关闭：- 在网址后加 `?mobileShell=0`，或\n- 在浏览器控制台执行 `localStorage.setItem('dsh-mobile-shell', '0')` 后刷新。","source":"extracted","section":"临时关闭"}
